  "title": ".NET 8 (Swashbuckle)",
  "description": "Optional: how OpenAPI worked in .NET 8 with Swashbuckle, as a baseline for the .NET 11 demos. Skipped in the talk. Start the app with `./start-demos.sh --dotnet8`.",
